  "purpose": "Test one mechanism-independent daily-price-path forecast: whether the current return sign combined with trailing first-order return autocorrelation predicts the next three-session long-only return.",
  "hypothesis": "Among quality-eligible, listing-seasoned A-shares, a high signed serial-dependence value identifies either an up session in a persistent return path or a down session in a mean-reverting path, and is associated with a higher return from the next local session open to the third local session close.",
